@startuml

title US11 - Register Parameter\nClass Diagram (CD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

enum MetricType {
    Numeric
    Qualitative
}

class Parameter {
    - code : wstring
    - name : wstring
    - description : wstring
    - metric : wstring
    - metricType : MetricType
    - minimumReferenceValue : optional<double>
    - maximumReferenceValue : optional<double>
    --
    + Parameter(code, name, description, metric, metricType, minimum, maximum)
    + Parameter(code, name, description, metric, minimum, maximum)
    + getCode() : const wstring&
    + getName() : const wstring&
    + getDescription() : const wstring&
    + getMetric() : const wstring&
    + getMetricType() : MetricType
    + getMinimumReferenceValue() : optional<double>
    + getMaximumReferenceValue() : optional<double>
    + {static} isValidCode(code) : bool
    + {static} isNumericMetric(metric) : bool
    + {static} isValidReferenceRange(minimum, maximum) : bool
}

class ParameterRepository {
    - parameters : vector<Parameter>
    --
    + add(parameter) : bool
    + findByCode(code) : const Parameter*
    + existsByCode(code) : bool
    + count() : size_t
}

class RegisterParameter {
    - repository : ParameterRepository&
    --
    + RegisterParameter(repository)
    + execute(code, name, description, metric, metricType, minimum, maximum) : bool
    + execute(code, name, description, metric, minimum, maximum) : bool
}

Parameter --> MetricType : uses
ParameterRepository "1" o-- "0..*" Parameter : stores
RegisterParameter --> ParameterRepository : uses
RegisterParameter ..> Parameter : creates

note right of Parameter
AC11-1:
Code must contain exactly
5 alphanumeric characters.

AC11-2:
Numeric metrics require
both minimum and maximum.

Qualitative metrics must not
have numeric reference values.

optional<double> represents
absence for Qualitative and
legacy C++ compatibility.
end note

@enduml